  <VanillaPsycastsExpanded.PsycasterPathDef Class="LichPhylactery.VPEBridge.LP_ClassPathDef"><defName>LP_Path_Monk</defName><label>武僧</label><description>DND 武僧以气御身：武艺、拨挡箭矢、乘风步、金刚之躯，疾风连击、震慑拳、开掌技、颤心掌，终极 空灵之身。徒手（或拿短棍）时最强；拳脚走原版近战结算，Isekai 的力量与武器精通照常生效；“气”的效果乘心灵敏感度。学习每一环都需要对应的格斗等级（6/9/12/15/18）。</description><tab>DND职业</tab><order>8</order><requiredSkill>Melee</requiredSkill><requiredSkillLevel>6</requiredSkillLevel><martial>true</martial><classPsychic>false</classPsychic><lockedReason>需要格斗 6 级（或冒险者敏捷 13）</lockedReason><tooltip>武僧：格斗决定气的强度，徒手时最强。</tooltip><background>LP/Classes/Monk/Background</background><altBackground>LP/Classes/Monk/Background</altBackground><backgroundColor>(0.48,0.34,0.14)</backgroundColor><ignoreLockRestrictionsForNeurotrainers>false</ignoreLockRestrictionsForNeurotrainers></VanillaPsycastsExpanded.PsycasterPathDef>
  <VanillaPsycastsExpanded.PsycasterPathDef Class="LichPhylactery.VPEBridge.LP_ClassPathDef"><defName>LP_Path_Paladin</defName><label>圣武士</label><description>DND 圣武士以誓言为剑：至圣斩、誓仇、神圣武器、援护换位（格斗），圣疗、守护灵光、勇气灵光、放逐邪恶（社交），终极 圣光化身。格斗或社交任一 6 级即可入门；每个能力看自己那门技能（6/9/12/15/18）。武器那一下照常结算，追加的神圣伤害和治疗乘心灵敏感度。巫妖不能学。</description><tab>DND职业</tab><order>6</order><requiredSkill>Melee</requiredSkill><alternateSkill>Social</alternateSkill><requiredSkillLevel>6</requiredSkillLevel><martial>true</martial><classPsychic>false</classPsychic><lockedReason>需要格斗或社交 6 级，或冒险者魅力 13（巫妖不能学）</lockedReason><tooltip>圣武士：格斗支执掌圣斩，社交支执掌灵光与圣疗。</tooltip><background>LP/Classes/Paladin/Background</background><altBackground>LP/Classes/Paladin/Background</altBackground><backgroundColor>(0.5,0.42,0.16)</backgroundColor><ignoreLockRestrictionsForNeurotrainers>false</ignoreLockRestrictionsForNeurotrainers></VanillaPsycastsExpanded.PsycasterPathDef>
